<dt> (^)    <a name="disarm"></a> <b>Disarm</b>

<dd> Disarm a trap.  This command can take a 
<a href="#numeric">numeric argument</a> to attempt disarming up to N times,
or until interrupted.  It is possible to set off a trap accidentally while
attempting to disarm it..

</dl>

